														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4842624">
									

<p>I'm not sure I really have a handle on what you're going for here. This is some kind of series involving a new internal division which stops end of the world scenarios — why does this division need to exist? Generally I think the understand is that the Foundation allows the relevant internal departments to handle matters like this, such that one department with a massive amount of sensitive information isn't tasked with lots of high-stakes cross-disciplinary work.</p>
<p>Additionally I'm not really getting what the narrative is. What other characters are there besides the main one, what does the department actually do, etc.? Can you give me a rundown of the plot?</p>

