														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4842571">
									

<p>The problem isn't that this isn't a great idea; it's that there isn't really a horror element here. All you've done is taken a standard cyber-punk element (leader uploaded) and put it into a standard action movie (Yakuza leader taking advantage of the death of the former leader).</p>
<p>There needs to be more than just a future-tech premise; it needs some sort of horror element. Upladed Diva in and of itself isn't a horror situation; there needs to be some sort additional weirdness to it. Now, if she were interacting directly, there was no way to turn off her computer, or she were possessing people, this would fit here better, but so far it's just SF.</p>
<p>Also, not really seeing The Foundation mentioned. Minor sticking point, sure, but for there to be an article on it The Foundation needs to be aware of it on some level.</p>

							</div>

								
					
